              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "britchick"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Hi we drink this in england all the time. But what we call lemonade is not the same as american lemonade, it is a lemon and lime soda like sprite or seven up. I can't imagine this would be good with american lemonade so give it a try with the soda, you won't be disapointed."
